The following reporting areas have Eclampsia data coded to "Not Reported": 
				Idaho 2007-2013; 
				Kentucky 2007-2012; 
				Michigan 2008-2013; 
				Nebraska 2007-2013; 
				New York (only counties comprising New York City) 2008-2012; 
				Pennsylvania 2007-2015; 
				South Carolina 2007-2021; 
				Tennessee 2007-2019; 
				Washington 2007-2012. 
